    PurgeExpiredWeeklySummariesCommand
    PurgeMonitoringAiContentCommand
    RescheduleFollowUpCommand
    SubmitPreVisitCheckInCommand
    SuggestQuestionsCommand
    SummarizeMonitoringCommand
